    { "lead": "Prepare the tested vegetable mix:", "ingredientIds": ["mixed-vegetables"], "after": "Use 150 g cubed potato, 80 g chopped onion, 80 g chopped tomato, 50 g chopped beans, 70 g diced carrot, 40 g frozen peas and 30 g frozen sweet corn." },
